List of serial FIRKODE C examples

  firk_analytic          : simple stiff, linear ODE                    (Radau IIA/DENSE)
  firk_diurnal_kry       : 2D diurnal kinetics PDE, user preconditioner (Radau IIA/SPGMR)
  firk_heat1D_fem_mass   : 1D heat equation, P1 FEM with mass matrix   (Radau IIA/BAND)
  firk_robertson         : stiff chemical kinetics ODE system          (Radau IIA/DENSE)
  firk_robertson_root    : stiff chemical kinetics with root-finding   (Radau IIA/DENSE)


The following CMake command was used to configure SUNDIALS:

 cmake \
-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=DEBUG \
-DBUILD_ARKODE=ON \
-DBUILD_CVODE=ON \
-DBUILD_CVODES=ON \
-DBUILD_IDA=ON \
-DBUILD_IDAS=ON \
-DBUILD_KINSOL=ON \
-DSUNDIALS_ENABLE_FIRKODE=ON \
-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/home/user1/sundials/build/install \
-DEXAMPLES_INSTALL_PATH=/home/user1/sundials/build/install/examples \
-DBUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF \
-DBUILD_STATIC_LIBS=ON \
-DEXAMPLES_ENABLE_C=ON \
-DEXAMPLES_ENABLE_CXX=ON \
-DEXAMPLES_INSTALL=ON \
../sundials

  System Architecture: x86_64
  Processor Type: Intel(R) Xeon(R) CPU E5-1650 v2 @ 3.50GHz
  Operating System: Red Hat 6.3
  C/Fortran Compilers: gcc/gfortran v4.4.6
